<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your credentials could not be verified</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>The {{credentials}} you entered for the {{environment}} environment of your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}) could not be verified, so they are not in use. Nothing changed: your OTA keeps its current connection.</p>
    <p>Reason: {{reason}} ({{errorCode}})</p>
    <p>Check the values and enter them again on the connection's page: <a href="{{connectionUrl}}">{{connectionUrl}}</a></p>
    <p>The Velexis team</p>
  </body>
</html>
